1
00:00:00,997 --> 00:00:03,297
(Amy:)I'm sure it's just
'cause I'm dating Sheldon.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,940
(Bert:)Mm, actually, I think Sheldon's
popular because he's dating you.

3
00:00:08,905 --> 00:00:10,675
(Penny:)Now Sheldon's popular?

4
00:00:10,674 --> 00:00:13,274
(Penny:)What is happening?

5
00:00:16,313 --> 00:00:18,083
(Howard:)Maybe we should break for lunch.

6
00:00:18,081 --> 00:00:19,081
(Howard:)What time is it?

7
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:25,922
(Leonard:)According to the world's worst
cuckoo clock, it's 2:00.

8
00:00:25,922 --> 00:00:28,292
(Sheldon:)My head hurts

9
00:00:28,291 --> 00:00:30,421
(Sheldon:)and I'm more tired than ever.

10
00:00:30,427 --> 00:00:31,857
(Howard:)Why don't you just go home?

11
00:00:31,862 --> 00:00:33,462
(Sheldon:)No, I can do this.

12
00:00:33,463 --> 00:00:37,033
(Sheldon:)I just, I just need
another energy drink.

13
00:00:37,033 --> 00:00:38,863
(Sheldon:)Oh, no.

14
00:00:38,869 --> 00:00:40,099
(Howard:)What?

15
00:00:40,103 --> 00:00:41,603
(Sheldon:)I want another one.

16
00:00:41,605 --> 00:00:42,605
(Leonard:)So?

17
00:00:42,606 --> 00:00:44,376
(Sheldon:)That's a craving.

18
00:00:44,374 --> 00:00:47,404
(Sheldon:)That's a sign of
chemical dependency.

19
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:48,940
(Leonard:)You only had one.

20
00:00:48,945 --> 00:00:50,075
(Sheldon:)No, I know,

21
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,350
(Sheldon:)but plenty of
things are addictive

22
00:00:51,348 --> 00:00:53,018
(Sheldon:)after a single exposure.

23
00:00:53,016 --> 00:00:57,016
(Sheldon:)I mean, crack cocaine,
nicotine, Pringles.

24
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,990
(Sheldon:)You know once one pops
one just can't stop.

